{{Quote|You do know that some Suertons have the ability to subconsciously affect probability?|[[Bazine Netal]], to [[Hondo Ohnaka]]|<ref name="Pirate's Price">''[[Pirate's Price]]''</ref>}}
The '''Suerton''' were a [[Sentience|sentient]] [[Reptile|reptilian]] [[species]] that lived in [[the galaxy]]. An eerily lucky species, the Suertons allegedly had the ability to subconsciously affect probability. The brothers [[Dodibin]], [[Thodibin]], and [[Wodibin]] were all Suertons<ref name="The Ride" /> from [[Chanceuxi]].<ref name="USWNE">''[[Ultimate Star Wars, New Edition]]''</ref>

{{Species-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
The name of the species was derived from the Spanish word "suerte," meaning luck.<ref name="sw.com">{{SW|url=news/much-to-learn-you-still-have-10-aliens-you-should-know-from-star-wars-the-last-jedis-canto-bight|text=Much to Learn You Still Have: 10 Aliens You Should Know from <i>Star Wars: The Last Jedi</i>'s Canto Bight}}</ref>

